  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Discover the Promising World of Teeth Implants in McLean, VA\n\n\nAugust 26, 2024\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nThese synthetic structures, typically made of titanium, replace missing teeth. Unlike dentures or bridges, teeth implants mimic the function of natural tooth roots, offering a solid foundation for crowns or dentures. This not only ensures a better appearance but also enhances oral health.\n\n\n## The Procedure of Getting Teeth Implants\n\n\nThe process of getting teeth implants in McLean, VA, involves several steps. Initially, a thorough dental checkup is conducted to ascertain the patient’s oral health condition. Next, the surgeon surgically embeds the dental implants into the patient’s jawbone.\n\nThe bone may take a few months to heal around the implant, forming a secure connection. Once healed, the surgeon attaches an abutment to the implant. This serves as the foundation for the new artificial tooth. A custom-made crown is fitted onto the abutment, resulting in a natural-looking, functional artificial tooth.\n\n\n## Pros and Cons of Teeth Implants in McLean, VA\n\n\nTooth implants come with numerous advantages. They enhance the appearance of your smile, enable you to eat and speak comfortably and improve oral health by maintaining facial structure and preventing bone loss. On the flip side, teeth implants may only be suitable for some. Patients need good general and oral health with sufficient bone density to support the implants. Suited for the long term, some patients may find the process lengthy and the cost more than alternative options.\n\n\n## Teeth Implants Vs. Other Dental Solutions\n\n\nCompared with dentures and bridges, teeth implants stand out for their longevity and durability. Unlike dentures, they don’t slip or make noise; unlike bridges, they don’t require adjoining teeth to be ground down. With proper care, teeth implants can last a lifetime, making them a cost-effective solution in the long run.\n\n\n## Our Expertise in Tooth Implants\n\n\nWe pride ourselves on our high expertise in dental implant procedures. Our team of skilled professionals uses advanced technology to ensure accurate implant placement for lasting results. We’re committed to providing comfortable, safe, and successful dental procedures to all our patients. In addition, our state-of-the-art facilities ensure that you receive top-quality care in a relaxed, welcoming environment.\n\nReady for a natural-looking, durable solution for your missing teeth? Consider teeth implants with Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA. Our experienced professionals are committed to providing expert care with a personal touch.\n\nContact us today to schedule a consultation and take your first step towards a healthier, confident smile with our doctor, Dr. Nahlah and the rest of our excellent team.\n\nPrevPreviousNavigating the World of Dental Implant Surgery in McLean, VA\n\nNextDeciphering Dental Implants: Your Guide to Implant Dentistry in McLean, VANext\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
